  {
    "name": "ExampleClass",
    "functions": [
      {
        "name": "sampleFunction",
        "docstring": "This is a sample function."
      },
      {
        "name": "anotherFunction",
        "docstring": "Another function."
      }
    ]
  }
]
```

This TypeScript code demonstrates how you can parse and extract class names and function names with their docstrings from a given codebase, using a simplified KickLang expression.
